"entity": {
"name": "AMG Critical Materials N.V.",
"description": "AMG Critical Materials NV engages in the manufacture and market of specialty metals and metallurgical vacuum furnace systems and provision of engineering services. It operates through the following segments: AMG Lithium, AMG Vanadium, and AMG Technologies. The AMG Lithium segment refers to the lithium and tantalum. The AMG Vanadium segment includes vanadium, titanium, and chrome metal. The AMG Technologies segment relates to engineering, antimony, graphite, silicon, and LIVA. The company was founded by Heinz C. Schimmelbusch on November 21, 2006 and is headquartered in Amsterdam, the Netherlands.",
